WEBVTT

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. {cool de tsuyoku...}

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.{iketeru to...}

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. {honto wa...}

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! {futsuu ni...}

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid {puressha nank...}

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. {sunao ni naritai...}

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. {kyarajanai toka...}

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! {atashi no kokoro...}

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. {shugo kyara ga...}

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! {zenzen...}

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. {hitotsu...}

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! {nandatte...}

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...{kitto}

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:47.520
A-Amu-chan!

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.910
Give me back my egg!

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:51.560
Fine.

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:53.690
If you're going to push it,

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:55.060
I'll give you a chance.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:58.640
Come to my lab after school tomorrow.

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:01.850
But you have to come alone.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:04.640
Keep this a secret from your Guardian buddies.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:13.140
Remake Honey! Who I want to be!

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:13.140
Episode 23

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:19.720
Su...

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.270
I have to hurry up and save her!

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:30.380
Excellent.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:32.350
It's finally complete.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.120
Sensei.

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:42.600
Sensei, what are you doing?

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.790
Sensei!

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.220
Sen-

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:49.220
Shut up!

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.810
You've been interfering with my programming this whole time.

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.340
But...

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.310
Um...

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:59.160
Hasn't that coffee gotten completely cold?

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.810
Aren't you going to make a new cup?

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:04.560
That's not important.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:15.290
Your room's really messy.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.930
Shall I tidy it up for you?

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.200
You can try to be clever and escape all you want,

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.140
but you aren't getting-

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:23.450
I won't try to escape.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:27.450
I'm just going to make some extra hot coffee and clean the room.

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:31.460
That's none of your business! Jeez.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.670
Sensei, are you okay?

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:45.240
An Easter employee dorm.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.510
He said it was on the outskirts of town, right?

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.410
I'm pretty sure it's somewhere around here.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.140
Can you guys sense anything?

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.320
Nope.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:56.180
Amu-chan, want me to get the Guardians?

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:00.390
Nikaidou told me to come by myself.

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:04.180
Who knows what'll happen to Su if I don't keep my word.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.350
His eyes were dead serious.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.270
Don't worry!

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.940
We're with you!

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:15.830
Right?

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:18.860
We can take care of Nikaidou in a jiffy with a Character Transformation!

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:19.890
A cinch, right?

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.110
He's just an old fart, right?

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:24.600
Just an old fart! Just an old fart! Yep!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:26.310
J-Just an old fart!

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:26.800
Hey.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:27.100
Ow!

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.310
Wh-What?

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.400
I-Ikuto?

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.930
Saying stuff like fart in broad daylight...

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.560
Pretty suspicious for a grade-schooler.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:34.380
Huh?

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.040
My, she said fart.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.180
And in broad daylight.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:39.290
Ikuto.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:40.980
Hitting on a grade-schooler?

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.490
Huh?

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.840
We're taking off without you.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:43.390
Okay.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:44.740
Huh?

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:45.250
What?

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:47.140
Are you wearing a school uniform?

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:49.570
You're a student, Ikuto?

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:51.100
'Course he is!

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:52.780
Oh.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:56.460
I kind of had this image of Ikuto living like an alley cat.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.140
Say...

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.760
You're headed for Nikaidou's place, right?

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:02.610
Huh? How did you know?

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.510
You just said it out loud.

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:05.270
Ah.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.420
He's one of Easter's minions.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:08.890
Did he come to interfere?

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.760
The former Easter employee dorm

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:14.280
is currently an abandoned ruin.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:17.770
Nikaidou has apparently been borrowing the place,

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:20.100
under the pretense of using it as a research lab.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:21.610
Research?

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:22.490
What kind of research?

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:23.360
Beats me.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:24.920
I didn't find that out.

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:28.100
Amu-chan, I saw the research lab!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:32.450
I could see a huge machine and X Eggs through the crack in my egg!

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:36.590
I heard Nikaidou on the phone with someone,

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:39.520
talking about "making the Embryo" and "the Boss" and stuff.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.620
"The Boss?"

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:45.630
The Boss is Easter's head honcho.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:50.590
Nikaidou is collecting X Eggs for the Boss as part of his plot.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.100
Him calling you here is some kind of trap.

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:56.890
They could devour you.

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:58.770
But you're still going?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.370
I'm going.

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:04.470
A promise is a promise, no matter who it's with.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:09.470
Fine then, do whatever you want.

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:11.750
This is...

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.040
When did we...

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.570
Ikuto, where are we?

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.830
Huh?

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.560
He disappeared.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.510
Ikuto.

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.110
Did he just help me?

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.400
Amu-chan, I can sense Su inside!

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.400
I'm coming, Su!

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.730
Sensei, here you are!

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:36.100
Freshly brewed extra hot coffee!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.820
I already said that I'm not a teacher anymore.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:41.470
Busy, busy.

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:43.750
Flutter, flutter. Flutter, flutter, flutter.

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:47.340
Flutter, flutter. Flutter, flutter, flutter.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:51.550
This place really needs tidying.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:52.350
Huh?

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:53.950
Robots?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.170
They're covered in dust.

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:59.110
I should clean them up.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.220
Don't bother.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:01.690
They're just junk.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.060
Junk?

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:04.440
In any case,

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.470
don't touch anything you don't have to.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.380
This boy...

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:15.970
Is you, isn't he?

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.850
Don't touch that!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.770
Okay.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.360
How sad.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:34.820
What's this?

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.710
My kitchen.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.100
Impressive, isn't it?

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.490
I'm about to use this kitchen

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:43.640
to make the Embryo.

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:46.470
Make the Embryo?

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:53.620
The ingredients are a large quantity of hearts' eggs,

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:56.820
and a special egg that can Character Transform.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:59.180
In other words, you.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:05.610
I doubt Hinamori's naive enough to come alone.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:08.390
But if she does, I'll use her other eggs, too.

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:14.890
Amu-chan! Amu-chan!

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:14.890
Shut up!

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:17.770
Man, you're really throwing me off here.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:20.290
It's time to get started.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:24.550
I'm going to inject all of that X Egg energy into your egg.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:29.680
You'll be reconstructed as a completely different egg.

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:32.140
A different egg?

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:34.560
Hop!

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:35.270
Step!

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:37.020
Jump!

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:39.270
Leaping tall gates with a single bound!

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:41.890
Su!

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:45.810
Well...

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.850
She really came alone.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.980
I've gotta hand it to that Joker.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:52.140
Amu-chan.

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.970
It's show time.

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.470
Amu-chan!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.150
Come on.

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:00.040
Hurry back into your egg.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.850
I feel sorry for those eggs!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:07.550
Besides, you can see Guardian Characters, Sensei.

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:10.680
Doesn't that mean you used to have a Guardian Character?

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.680
Sensei!

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:16.330
Sensei!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.660
Craft Room

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:18.640
Sensei!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.100
Hey.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:25.160
My dream is to become a robot professor, huh?

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.370
That's one big dream.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.820
I'll build the ultimate robot aid!

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.920
One that can carry juice with its hands!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.850
A modern tea-serving doll, huh?

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:39.890
I was pretty moved when I saw one as a child.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:44.960
My dream was to build something similar, so I began studying robotics.

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:46.600
Yeah?

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:50.700
Let's compete to see who can reach their dream first.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:51.860
Okay!

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.180
You're on!

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.600
What is this?

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:00.820
An egg?

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.140
Sensei?

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:10.180
What is this?

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.880
Robots?

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:27.980
Robots?

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.010
What do we do? What do we do?

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:34.140
We can't get past this many of them!

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:42.020
The engines of my robot soldiers are powered by X Eggs.

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:44.520
They make excellent playmates, don't you agree?

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:47.890
Amu-chan.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:48.930
Okay, then.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.520
We should get started as well.

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:55.790
Amu-chan!

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:56.560
Yeah.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.430
My heart: Unlock!

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:17.770
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.810
Colorful Canvas!

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:25.850
All right!

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:27.270
Hey!

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:30.180
L-Let me go!

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.220
Ran!

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:36.550
Thanks, Amu-chan.

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:38.220
Yeah, but...

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:40.390
This doesn't look too good!

00:11:40.390 --> 00:11:42.670
Jeez, how many are there?

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:44.470
Amu-chan, above you!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:46.270
Oh no!

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:53.060
Can't say that I appreciate you sneaking off, Hinamori.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.360
Like I already said...

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:57.140
When a friend's in trouble, we're all in trouble.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:59.810
It isn't very friendly of you to leave us out.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:00.690
Yep, yep.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.170
We're also worried about Su-chan!

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:05.470
Guys...

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:06.650
Hm?

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:08.350
But how did you know I was here?

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:09.610
That's because...

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:11.990
The black cat suddenly showed up.

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:15.760
Head to the abandoned building on the outskirts of town.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:18.050
You'll get to see something interesting.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:20.100
Ikuto told them?

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:22.140
Stupid thieving cat.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:24.160
What is he plotting?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.440
Who cares, who cares?

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:27.270
We managed to find Amu-chi!

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:28.520
Okay, everyone!

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:30.060
Let's go!

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:33.470
Character Change!

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:43.600
Gigantic Rattle Attack!

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:49.320
Lucky!

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:50.430
Take that!

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:52.450
Go, Hinamori!

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:54.640
Thanks, everyone.

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:56.880
Hold on, Su!

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:00.090
Sensei!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.180
Please stop!

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:05.160
It's too late.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.550
You should feel honored

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.850
to be reborn as the Embryo.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:12.890
You're really a good person, Sensei!

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.870
Your Guardian Character will be sad if you do this!

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:24.020
My Guardian Character died before it was even born.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:26.300
Huh?

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.430
Sensei quit?

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.850
His wife fell ill, apparently,

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:33.430
and he suddenly had to retire.

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:36.890
It's unfortunate, but the Craft Club will also have to go.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:41.270
I hope you'll grow out of robots once you're an older student.

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:43.760
You should study instead of chasing childish dreams.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.690
Keep your grades up.

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:47.890
Do you want to be a loser in life?

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:50.810
Another failure!

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:53.390
Why won't you move, you stupid piece of junk?

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.270
You deserve to be scrapped!

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:57.930
Oh no.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:13:59.980
The egg.

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:04.390
Humpty Dumpty.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.030
A broken egg

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:11.910
can never be put together again.

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:16.970
Some dreams never come true once other things interfere.

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:19.640
I chose reality over dreams.

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:21.680
Sensei.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:27.270
I gave up on my worthless dreams.

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:29.560
I'm going to be a winner.

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:43.520
Wait!

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:45.720
Hello, Himamori-san.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:47.850
You're just in time

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:50.970
to witness the moment the new Embryo is born.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:52.810
Amu-chan!

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:54.680
Su!

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:58.970
Sorry, but could you stand farther back as you observe,

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:00.950
Himamori-san?

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.010
Amu-chan!

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:06.570
Me this time!

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:07.750
Okay.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:09.060
Tag!

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:19.850
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.180
Heart Rod!

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:24.130
That again, huh?

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:26.310
Did you practice first this time?

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:30.220
Spiral Heart!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.310
Too bad.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:39.350
Shoot! The machine!

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.570
Su!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:44.570
Amu-chan!

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:47.810
I was so scared!

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:50.660
Hey now, that tickles!

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:51.970
Who cares?

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.680
The X Egg energy is leaking out!

00:15:58.680 --> 00:15:59.640
Huh?

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:09.470
Wh-What?

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:23.890
A huge robot?

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:31.700
C-Clumping together won't scare me!

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:33.720
I'll take all of you out together!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:42.310
You can't destroy it, Amu-chan!

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.020
Let me handle this!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.560
Let's Character Transform!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:53.180
My heart: Unlock!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:35.390
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:40.730
Amu-chan!

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:42.020
Let's do it!

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.320
Okay!

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:47.060
Sugar, honey, syrup.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:51.020
Let irritation and gloom melt into something sweet!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:55.100
Remake Honey!

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:12.640
They're all turning back to normal!

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:15.310
Amu-chan!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:16.380
Huh?

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:26.180
The X Eggs are being cleansed!

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:29.490
They're going back to their owners!

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:34.350
When something needs fixing, leave it to me!

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:49.770
My egg!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.350
That's your egg?

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:53.430
Yep.

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:01.100
I thought I'd lost it.

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:07.200
I'm glad we can finally meet!

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.720
Are you my Guardian Character?

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:11.760
Uh-huh.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:13.470
But I have to go now.

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:14.200
Huh?

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:16.000
Good-bye.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:16.810
See you again.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:24.850
I knew it.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.150
It's futile.

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:28.950
I've chosen a different path.

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:30.580
I can never go back.

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:34.680
A broken egg can never be put back together again.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:36.790
Su!

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.250
But Sensei...

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:41.890
He said, "see you again."

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:47.580
Keep reinventing and polishing yourself, and who you want to be

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.850
can be reborn over and over.

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:57.890
After all, you can still see us, right?

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:05.950
In any case,

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:10.170
my Embryo creation plan has failed, even after expending all those resources.

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:12.180
It's a total screw-up.

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:14.830
There's no denying that I'm a loser now.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:16.010
Loser?

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:18.360
Who were you competing with?

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.720
That would be...

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:23.820
Society as a whole, I guess?

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.220
You can't remember?

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:27.810
Then it couldn't have been much of an opponent.

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:30.060
Amu-chan!

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:32.500
Are you okay?

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:33.140
Guys!

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:34.480
Nikaidou!

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:35.690
Prepare yourself!

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:37.450
Hey, wait a second!

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:40.700
Thanks, everyone.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.210
But it's okay now.

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:43.720
Nothing happened to any of us,

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.640
and Su's back safe and sound.

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:48.350
Sorry to worry you all.

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:51.330
Well, if Hinamori says it's okay...

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:53.900
In that case, let's get going.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:55.020
Yes.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.270
Uh-huh.

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.950
Man, I'm not satisfied.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:02.520
Well, just don't sweat the small stuff.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.640
Bye-bye, Sensei.

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:08.770
See you again.

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:10.560
Good-bye!

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:43.990
I was finally sacked by Easter.

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:47.060
Now what'll I do?

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:50.080
Might as well check the classifieds.

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:53.040
This is...

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.080
Sensei!

00:21:54.550 --> 00:21:57.640
Reproducing an Edo period karakuri doll?

00:21:57.640 --> 00:21:59.710
He didn't give up.

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:14.550
Keep reinventing and polishing yourself, and who you want to be

00:22:14.550 --> 00:22:18.340
can be reborn over and over.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.890
Unless the world ends, I'll always {sekai ga...}

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:44.660
love you!  Yeah, you! {suki da yo...}

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:48.130
'Cause I just love, love, love you! {suki suki suki...}

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.860
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living. {jitabata...}

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.540
So figure it out already! Yeah, you! {kizukeyo...}

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.180
Even though I love, love, love you, {suki suki suki...}

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:05.370
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't! {iitaikuseni...}

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:09.490
I wanna show you what's in my heart! {tsutaetai...}

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:12.920
Oh yes! You're my one true hero. {oh yes!...}

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:18.080
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.  {koishiterukagiri...}

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:24.010
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider? {hashitsuzukero...}

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:29.260
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger. {yuuyake...}

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:38.130
Ride through the wild land of youth. {seishun no...}

00:23:50.060 --> 00:23:53.200
There's a sketching contest next week, huh?

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:54.570
What are you supposed to draw?

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:56.390
Your favorite place.

00:23:56.390 --> 00:23:58.470
But will I be able to do a good job?

00:23:58.470 --> 00:23:59.880
Why don't you practice now?

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:01.190
That's right, Amu-chan!

00:24:01.190 --> 00:24:01.970
Work hard!

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:03.850
R-Right, I'll practice in a bit.

00:24:03.850 --> 00:24:06.680
Well then, while Amu-chan is practicing...

00:24:06.680 --> 00:24:08.170
You're gonna say it?

00:24:08.170 --> 00:24:10.100
Yep, I'm gonna say it!

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:11.570
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.570 --> 00:24:12.910
Sketch of the Heart!

00:24:12.910 --> 00:24:13.610
I'm done!

00:24:13.610 --> 00:24:14.360
What's it look like?

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:15.900
Three monsters!

00:24:15.900 --> 00:24:17.220
So scary!

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:18.870
This is supposed to be you guys.

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:20.100
Huh?
